@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "Unity session" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "DiskQueue" as P1 <<file store>>
participant "TelemetryUploader" as P2 <<service>>
participant "Backend routing" as P3 <<boundary>>
P0 -> P1: Store the completed session batch
P2 -> P1: Read pending batches oldest first
P1 --> P2: Return the next saved batch
P2 -> P3: Send the legacy session batch
note over P2,P3: Current client and server contracts differ. No compatible server action accepts this legacy request.
P3 --> P2: Reject the incompatible request
P2 -> P1: Keep the batch for a later retry
note over P0,P2: Gameplay continues. A bounded queue prunes oldest overflow; it is not unlimited retention.
@enduml